  "solution": {
    "text": "In SF<sub>6</sub>, S sterically hindered by six fluorine atoms hence, attack of H<sub>2</sub>O molecule will not occur. NF<sub>3</sub><sub> </sub>is not hydrolysed due to absence of vacant orbital either on N of F atom.<br />TeF<sub>6</sub> is hydrolysed due to large size of Te.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>NCl</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>4</mn> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>&rarr;</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>NH</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mtext>OH</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>HOCl</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>TeF</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>6</mn> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>&rarr;</mo></mtd> <mtd> <mn>6</mn> <mtext>HF</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>TeO</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>Telluric acid</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math>",
